  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut potato into fries. Place on a lined oven tray.\n• Season with salt, drizzle with olive oil and toss to coat. Bake until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a065f49e3e3f5847289e0c-3bbd528a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Roughly chop tomato.\n• In a medium bowl, combine mixed salad leaves, tomato, a drizzle of olive oil, 1/2 the plant-based mayonnaise and a generous pinch of salt.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a065f49e3e3f5847289e0c-ad126ad0.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a small bowl combine sweet & savoury glaze, the soy sauce and a splash of water.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a065f49e3e3f5847289e0c-e62abfc5.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut the haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• When fries have 10 minutes remaining, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Remove from heat. Add sauce mixture, turning to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a065f49e3e3f5847289e0c-bdbc8526.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the haloumi is cooking, halve continental rolls and bake directly on a wire oven rack until heated through, 3 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a065f49e3e3f5847289e0c-3b16b739.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Top bun bases with haloumi and slaw. Spoon over remaining glaze in the pan.\n• Divide sweet chilli glazed haloumi burger and fries between plates. Serve with remaining mayo. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a065f49e3e3f5847289e0c-4bc3031c.jpeg"
    }
  ]
